{
 "about": "PIP customizations through POST /access/v1/pip/customization/import (a customize step with pips, round 29): replace, replace with some fields only, disable, add, the import errors, two levels, two imports at one level, the level parameter, and an import the PIP upload would refuse. The HEADER PIP subject.parityR29Cp reads X-Parity-Cp, which each request sends as w; X-Parity-Cp2 carries v. The rule allows on subject.parityR29Cp CONTAINS 'v' OR resource.a == 'y', so a = n tells whether the customization reached the declaration. The GENERAL PIP answers {\"a\": [\"w\"], \"groups\": [\"v\"]}. The runner deletes the case's PIP customizations (DELETE /access/v1/pip/customization/pip/{name}) before its upload and after its last step.",
 "resourceTypePrefix": "PARITY_SUITE_R29ST_",
